# Flutter Comments App

A responsive Flutter Web app with a comment feature, connected to a Python FastAPI backend using SQLite,
1. To store the comments permanent and 
2. To view the existing comment.

-------------------------------------------------------------------

## **Features**

- HTML content with proper viewport for responsiveness which supports all screen sizes.
- Comment section where users can post and view the comments.
- Backend stores comments permanently using SQLite database.
- Works on all modern web browsers.

-------------------------------------------------------------------

Note: In frontend is configured to access the backend at http://localhost:8000/comments. 
To test the app, and to ensure the FastAPI backend is running on your machine.

